python-nanorecall (0.1.6-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Release version 0.1.6 with Flat Assembler (FASM) bare-metal SIMD microkernels.
  * Direct AVX2+FMA (x86-64) and SSE2 (x86 32-bit) desktop frame differencing.
  * Vectorized perceptual hashing, cosine memory similarity, and privacy masking.
  * Standalone assembly test binaries and Free-Threaded CPython 3.13t-3.16t No-GIL support.

